pmd:PMD_0000626 rdfs:subClassOf pmd:PMD_0000945, _:cc8466d1;
    a owl:Class;
    rdfs:label "Elektronenspektroskopie"@de, "electron spectroscopy"@en;
    skos:definition "A spectroscopy process, that studies the energy distribution of electrons emitted from a sample when it is irradiated with electromagnetic radiation or bombarded with particles."@en, "Ein Spektroskopie Verfahren, das die Energieverteilung von Elektronen untersucht, die aus einer Probe emittiert werden, wenn diese mit elektromagnetischer Strahlung bestrahlt oder mit Teilchen bombardiert wird."@de;
    skos:example "Examples are e.g. Auger electron spectroscopy, electron energy loss spectroscopy, secondary electron spectroscopy."@en;
    <urn:vg:loadedFrom> <https://ontosphere.test/eval-fixtures/3b98aad/pmdco.ttl>.
pmd:PMD_0020246 rdfs:subClassOf pmd:PMD_0020245;
    a owl:Class;
    rdfs:label "continous transport"@en;
    skos:definition "recurring transport of multiple entities, such that the transported entities are not being discretized anymore"@en;
    skos:example "the flow of a liquid in a pipe, diffusion of a gas in different gas"@en;
    <urn:vg:loadedFrom> <https://ontosphere.test/eval-fixtures/3b98aad/pmdco.ttl>.
